    "detailed_description": "You play as a stone that has to get to the finish line and a skateboard helps him in this.<br />\r\nYou have no control over anything but the turns of the skate wheels. Give in to freedom and enjoy the ride.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have to go through the same level dozens of times before you reach the goal, but should that scare you?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n- 2 Completely different locations<br />\r\n- 10 different levels in each location<br />\r\n- Unusual gaming experience<br />\r\n- Challenging physics to overcome the road<br />\r\n- Dynamic music that will keep you in good shape throughout the journey",
    "about_the_game": "You play as a stone that has to get to the finish line and a skateboard helps him in this.<br />\r\nYou have no control over anything but the turns of the skate wheels. Give in to freedom and enjoy the ride.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have to go through the same level dozens of times before you reach the goal, but should that scare you?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n- 2 Completely different locations<br />\r\n- 10 different levels in each location<br />\r\n- Unusual gaming experience<br />\r\n- Challenging physics to overcome the road<br />\r\n- Dynamic music that will keep you in good shape throughout the journey",
